+The local policy is intentionally conservative: every one of the nine fixed shift candidates must have a valid rank-conditioned content fit in a tile. Otherwise all symbols in that tile use the committed global component. This all-candidates-must-fit rule likely explains the table's `4/234` coverage. Baseline fallback counts and fractions are serialized; they are not hidden as local evidence.
